# FSD Test Case Generator

When working with FSD files or test case generation requests:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/fsd-test-case-generator/SKILL.md` and follow it completely.
2. Read the **entire** FSD before generating any test cases.
3. Use FSD as the sole source of truth — no invented functionality, endpoints, or schema.
4. Generate test cases starting at `TC_001` with full traceability to Requirement IDs.
5. Save Excel-ready CSV output to `output/<project>/`.
6. Deliver the 10-section final report.

Check `fsd/` for uploaded specification documents.
